Comment: 0,0:02:26.87,0:02:28.16,bebop,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Comment: 0,0:02:32.53,0:02:33.88,bebop,,0,0,0,,Yeah...

Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.13,0:00:50.57,bebop,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He was always alone,{\i0}\N{\i1}always by himself.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.89,0:00:55.62,bebop,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Never anyone to share the game.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.63,0:00:59.12,bebop,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He lived in another world.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.17,0:01:01.49,bebop,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He was that kinda guy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.07,0:01:10.05,bebop,,0,0,0,,C'mon Spike, get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.31,0:01:19.77,bebop,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.48,0:01:26.54,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's like a pot of stew bubbling on the stove.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.54,0:01:33.05,bebop,,0,0,0,,All mixed up,\Nwith no telling what's good or what's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.05,0:01:35.52,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.52,0:01:38.84,bebop,,0,0,0,,But there's one thing you shouldn't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:41.41,bebop,,0,0,0,,You know what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.81,0:01:43.91,bebop,,0,0,0,,Meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.63,0:01:47.59,bebop,,0,0,0,,Everyone says that, but that's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.59,0:01:51.98,bebop,,0,0,0,,Without the basic stock, you don't have a stew.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.98,0:01:55.63,bebop,,0,0,0,,If you add curry powder, you get curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.63,0:01:58.17,bebop,,0,0,0,,We have stock cubes in the pantry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.17,0:02:00.09,bebop,,0,0,0,,Not that, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.15,0:02:04.90,bebop,,0,0,0,,Great, a wannabe preacher with a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.90,0:02:06.35,bebop,,0,0,0,,C'mon Spike.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.90,0:02:09.24,bebop,,0,0,0,,There's three of 'em.\NI'll go around the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.24,0:02:10.42,bebop,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.15,0:02:17.45,bebop,,0,0,0,,No point waiting for the cops.\NI know your security here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.45,0:02:18.90,bebop,,0,0,0,,You know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.90,0:02:21.57,bebop,,0,0,0,,Renzi, hurry it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.57,0:02:24.33,bebop,,0,0,0,,You see this logo:\NThat's your security company.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.33,0:02:26.87,bebop,,0,0,0,,I used to work for those guys, not long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.16,0:02:32.53,bebop,,0,0,0,,I got laid off so I took up robbery.\NFunny, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.88,0:02:35.16,bebop,,0,0,0,,Go on, laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.79,0:02:37.65,bebop,,0,0,0,,Funny, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.65,0:02:39.40,bebop,,0,0,0,,It sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.75,0:02:43.51,bebop,,0,0,0,,Stop laughing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.70,0:02:51.21,bebop,,0,0,0,,Hey, we're closed.\NGo someplace else.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.45,0:03:01.16,bebop,,0,0,0,,Now go ahead and fill up my money card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.07,0:03:06.03,bebop,,0,0,0,,Hey, who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.42,0:03:09.39,bebop,,0,0,0,,Are you deaf?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.31,0:03:11.99,bebop,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.44,0:03:19.92,bebop,,0,0,0,,You!\NTake your earphones off!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.92,0:03:20.80,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'll take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.63,0:03:44.37,bebop,,0,0,0,,Spike!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.46,0:03:51.06,bebop,,0,0,0,,These crooks will pay for my donuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.98,0:04:03.01,bebop,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.84,0:04:06.01,bebop,,0,0,0,,Hey Jet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.01,0:04:07.40,bebop,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.40,0:04:09.54,bebop,,0,0,0,,You said there were three...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.54,0:04:11.61,bebop,,0,0,0,,Drop your guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.61,0:04:14.36,bebop,,0,0,0,,To fool an enemy, first fool yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.36,0:04:16.18,bebop,,0,0,0,,What's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.18,0:04:17.20,bebop,,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.20,0:04:19.59,bebop,,0,0,0,,You spend too long on the toilet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.59,0:04:23.03,bebop,,0,0,0,,You want the old lady to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.13,0:04:34.37,bebop,,0,0,0,,You hear me?\NYou see the gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.82,0:04:36.80,bebop,,0,0,0,,Sorry, granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.80,0:04:39.92,bebop,,0,0,0,,We ain't cops or security guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.92,0:04:43.60,bebop,,0,0,0,,It ain't our job to save your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.60,0:04:44.63,bebop,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.23,0:04:47.14,bebop,,0,0,0,,Bad luck, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.04,0:04:49.19,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's a Cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.19,0:04:51.53,bebop,,0,0,0,,What are you blabbing about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.53,0:04:53.02,bebop,,0,0,0,,Don't shoot me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.49,0:05:08.59,bebop,,0,0,0,,Cowboy, who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.00,0:05:14.89,bebop,,0,0,0,,Just a bounty hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.96,0:07:29.22,bebop,,0,0,0,,Hurry up with that move, Jet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.22,0:07:30.99,bebop,,0,0,0,,Don't rush me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.23,0:07:43.87,bebop,,0,0,0,,Do you plan your moves?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.87,0:07:45.69,bebop,,0,0,0,,Just hurry up...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.69,0:07:48.70,bebop,,0,0,0,,Listen, in shogi,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.70,0:07:53.19,bebop,,0,0,0,,you think 100 moves ahead then make your play.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.42,0:08:02.91,bebop,,0,0,0,,You head off your opponent's attack.\NThat's how you play.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.91,0:08:06.13,bebop,,0,0,0,,You don't just move at random.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.92,0:08:09.17,bebop,,0,0,0,,I want to move here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.17,0:08:12.63,bebop,,0,0,0,,Take your finger off, and you've moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.63,0:08:15.93,bebop,,0,0,0,,You're far too easygoing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.93,0:08:17.49,bebop,,0,0,0,,Now listen, Spike.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.49,0:08:21.32,bebop,,0,0,0,,One's character emerges in shogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.32,0:08:25.00,bebop,,0,0,0,,You obviously react to each move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.00,0:08:26.39,bebop,,0,0,0,,Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.40,0:08:30.94,bebop,,0,0,0,,What would you've done\Nif you'd hit the hostage?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.94,0:08:32.70,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'd have dealt with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.70,0:08:39.46,bebop,,0,0,0,,It was too risky for a measly 1.25 million bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.46,0:08:43.71,bebop,,0,0,0,,There's no drama in bounty hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.71,0:08:47.90,bebop,,0,0,0,,Before you became my partner,\Nlife was much quieter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.00,0:08:57.78,bebop,,0,0,0,,Good, I was considering that myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.78,0:08:59.35,bebop,,0,0,0,,Well, Spike?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.56,0:09:05.60,bebop,,0,0,0,,I found it, I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.15,0:09:50.65,bebop,,0,0,0,,Faye-Faye, a message for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.65,0:09:56.40,bebop,,0,0,0,,Target heading for town, using booth 8 on Route 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.03,0:10:00.91,bebop,,0,0,0,,OK, get me an ID on him and the vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.90,0:10:08.17,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's some kid. I hate bounty hunting boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.68,0:11:10.19,bebop,,0,0,0,,That's not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.19,0:12:28.67,bebop,,0,0,0,,Time for the CBC news.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.67,0:12:30.97,bebop,,0,0,0,,Today's top story.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.97,0:12:34.31,bebop,,0,0,0,,At 10 am on the No 7 highway,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.31,0:12:37.45,bebop,,0,0,0,,a tanker truck exploded into flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.45,0:12:42.50,bebop,,0,0,0,,Seventy-two persons are dead and 425 suffered injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.50,0:12:45.99,bebop,,0,0,0,,We have a live report from Lylie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.49,0:12:48.57,bebop,,0,0,0,,Reporting from the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.57,0:12:53.50,bebop,,0,0,0,,The wreckage is being removed and the area cleaned up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.50,0:12:57.46,bebop,,0,0,0,,People within a 2-mile radius of the crash site
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.46,0:13:00.84,bebop,,0,0,0,,were soon overcome by the noxious fumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.84,0:13:04.07,bebop,,0,0,0,,A general panic ensued.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.07,0:13:08.89,bebop,,0,0,0,,Three hours after the accident,\Ncalm has returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.89,0:13:13.85,bebop,,0,0,0,,Is there a possibility the truck was carrying a poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.85,0:13:18.50,bebop,,0,0,0,,Yes, the police suspect either a toxic chemical,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.50,0:13:24.08,bebop,,0,0,0,,or a biological hazard.\NThe area has been sealed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.08,0:13:27.03,bebop,,0,0,0,,Any leads on why it exploded?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.03,0:13:29.99,bebop,,0,0,0,,No information at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.99,0:13:35.47,bebop,,0,0,0,,But police say the vehicle had been stolen earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.47,0:13:40.99,bebop,,0,0,0,,They suspect this could be a case of biological terrorism.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.99,0:13:42.76,bebop,,0,0,0,,Live from the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.20,0:13:45.41,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's on every channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.54,0:13:48.13,bebop,,0,0,0,,Deja vu, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.14,0:13:53.85,bebop,,0,0,0,,It feels like I had instant noodles last night, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.38,0:13:56.40,bebop,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.40,0:14:00.28,bebop,,0,0,0,,You've had that for dinner three days in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.28,0:14:01.29,bebop,,0,0,0,,You forgot?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.29,0:14:04.52,bebop,,0,0,0,,Really? I thought it was a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.52,0:14:07.14,bebop,,0,0,0,,We've got other instant food.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.14,0:14:11.91,bebop,,0,0,0,,We have flat white and buckwheat noodles, all instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.91,0:14:16.52,bebop,,0,0,0,,We've got even instant sushi,\Nbut it's over a year old.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.52,0:14:17.74,bebop,,0,0,0,,Try your luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.74,0:14:19.63,bebop,,0,0,0,,Itadakimasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.97,0:14:34.86,bebop,,0,0,0,,Just carbohydrates aren't very good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.86,0:14:37.22,bebop,,0,0,0,,Man needs protein.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.22,0:14:39.18,bebop,,0,0,0,,What are you on about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.18,0:14:41.40,bebop,,0,0,0,,I said I like meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.40,0:14:46.11,bebop,,0,0,0,,Forget small-time punks, we need a big bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.65,0:14:52.99,bebop,,0,0,0,,How did it go with you, Faye?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.99,0:14:56.08,bebop,,0,0,0,,Terrible. Wanna hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.08,0:15:02.00,bebop,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say your hacker was easy to trace?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.00,0:15:04.85,bebop,,0,0,0,,I got caught up in that explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.85,0:15:07.27,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'll take one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.27,0:15:10.45,bebop,,0,0,0,,Plus, I lost big at the races.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.45,0:15:13.12,bebop,,0,0,0,,Look, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.12,0:15:14.96,bebop,,0,0,0,,You were there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.96,0:15:18.60,bebop,,0,0,0,,Well, it was quite an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.60,0:15:22.93,bebop,,0,0,0,,Huh... virus, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.93,0:15:26.10,bebop,,0,0,0,,Oh no, a chemical weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.00,0:15:31.07,bebop,,0,0,0,,What's up with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.07,0:15:32.70,bebop,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.70,0:15:34.06,bebop,,0,0,0,,Even the dog's avoiding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.06,0:15:36.93,bebop,,0,0,0,,"Dirty, dirty, full of germs!"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.14,0:15:41.04,bebop,,0,0,0,,Cut that out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.04,0:15:46.63,bebop,,0,0,0,,The Mars government is offering\Na reward of 300 million Woolong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.63,0:15:48.11,bebop,,0,0,0,,Three hundred million?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.11,0:15:48.88,bebop,,0,0,0,,Nya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.96,0:16:18.32,bebop,,0,0,0,,What can it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.32,0:16:19.38,bebop,,0,0,0,,You too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.38,0:16:20.22,bebop,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.63,0:16:28.66,bebop,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.66,0:16:32.28,bebop,,0,0,0,,I've never seen symptoms like these.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.28,0:16:35.96,bebop,,0,0,0,,They all show unnatural pressure on the brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.96,0:16:40.56,bebop,,0,0,0,,But we have no idea what's causing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.56,0:16:42.91,bebop,,0,0,0,,I haven't got a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.91,0:16:48.26,bebop,,0,0,0,,On admittance, they all showed reactions\Nin the lymph corpuscles.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.26,0:16:53.40,bebop,,0,0,0,,Their condition is worsening but\Nthe lymphs are now normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.40,0:16:56.80,bebop,,0,0,0,,Could it be smallpox or Ebola?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.80,0:17:02.15,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's no virus that we know of,\Nand it's not a nerve gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.15,0:17:03.83,bebop,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.83,0:17:09.92,bebop,,0,0,0,,We can't find any traces,\Nnot even in the dead bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.94,0:17:15.21,bebop,,0,0,0,,It must be some kind of an unknown virus,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.21,0:17:18.76,bebop,,0,0,0,,or some form of a germ warfare agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.52,0:17:21.92,bebop,,0,0,0,,This could be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.26,0:17:37.62,bebop,,0,0,0,,Sorry. It's my allergy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.88,0:17:47.32,bebop,,0,0,0,,I know by now we've cured most allergies,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.32,0:17:49.79,bebop,,0,0,0,,but this could be viral.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.79,0:17:54.28,bebop,,0,0,0,,Someone could be deliberately spreading it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.28,0:17:55.89,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's a no-smoking area.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.72,0:18:01.81,bebop,,0,0,0,,What do they want?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.43,0:18:06.59,bebop,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.59,0:18:09.44,bebop,,0,0,0,,If not, we'll all end up dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.44,0:18:10.99,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's starting now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.99,0:18:12.88,bebop,,0,0,0,,Bio-terrorists, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.88,0:18:15.52,bebop,,0,0,0,,Spike, you'd better watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.52,0:18:16.83,bebop,,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.83,0:18:19.60,bebop,,0,0,0,,This information doesn't come cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.60,0:18:22.22,bebop,,0,0,0,,We know that. Hurry it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.22,0:18:23.93,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's very valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.93,0:18:25.52,bebop,,0,0,0,,Ed, start now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.52,0:18:26.66,bebop,,0,0,0,,Ayyy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.30,0:18:31.36,bebop,,0,0,0,,Lee Samson, computer hacker.\NA bounty of 5 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.36,0:18:36.00,bebop,,0,0,0,,We traced his card with false ID on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.00,0:18:37.08,bebop,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.08,0:18:39.67,bebop,,0,0,0,,I hacked their database.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.67,0:18:44.17,bebop,,0,0,0,,He used the card to rent a car that was blown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.17,0:18:48.13,bebop,,0,0,0,,But Lee wasn't in it, probably an accomplice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.80,0:18:50.30,bebop,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.44,0:18:53.78,bebop,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.78,0:18:58.95,bebop,,0,0,0,,You expect us to hunt him down\Nwith these flimsy leads?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.95,0:19:03.15,bebop,,0,0,0,,But it's all inside my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.15,0:19:05.08,bebop,,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.08,0:19:09.16,bebop,,0,0,0,,You can draw on the monitor with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.16,0:19:12.79,bebop,,0,0,0,,We don't even know if he's the terrorist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.79,0:19:17.57,bebop,,0,0,0,,He didn't have a mask on,\Nso he'd be dead by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.57,0:19:19.59,bebop,,0,0,0,,No, he didn't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.59,0:19:21.07,bebop,,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.07,0:19:23.80,bebop,,0,0,0,,Women's intuition.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.80,0:19:26.18,bebop,,0,0,0,,Intuition?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.18,0:19:27.52,bebop,,0,0,0,,Finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.69,0:19:30.27,bebop,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.27,0:19:33.05,bebop,,0,0,0,,That's a helluva face.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.05,0:19:35.10,bebop,,0,0,0,,A-nya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.10,0:19:40.47,bebop,,0,0,0,,If you can find a face like that,\NI'll pay the bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.47,0:19:44.53,bebop,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm wasting my time here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.53,0:19:46.28,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'll get him by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.01,0:19:50.52,bebop,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a waste of time to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.52,0:19:52.92,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'll start on the virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.92,0:19:55.52,bebop,,0,0,0,,What? Now you're interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.52,0:19:59.09,bebop,,0,0,0,,You can bank on a woman's intuition.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.09,0:20:00.13,bebop,,0,0,0,,But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.60,0:20:04.39,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of eating out of Styrofoam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.16,0:21:16.40,bebop,,0,0,0,,I used to fly every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.40,0:21:18.82,bebop,,0,0,0,,We sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.82,0:21:24.33,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'd love to fly again, maybe as far as Saturn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.33,0:21:25.74,bebop,,0,0,0,,You liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.74,0:21:30.03,bebop,,0,0,0,,The biggest thing you ever flew\Nwas a crop duster.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.03,0:21:31.75,bebop,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.75,0:21:32.85,bebop,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.89,0:21:36.28,bebop,,0,0,0,,I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.28,0:21:39.14,bebop,,0,0,0,,No point, we're all going deaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.14,0:21:41.85,bebop,,0,0,0,,Where's the bean seller?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.85,0:21:44.90,bebop,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of them down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.90,0:21:47.96,bebop,,0,0,0,,No, I want to buy the other "beans".
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.96,0:21:50.19,bebop,,0,0,0,,You're an undercover cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.19,0:21:51.96,bebop,,0,0,0,,Do I look like a cop?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.96,0:21:54.48,bebop,,0,0,0,,More like a gangster.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.48,0:21:56.54,bebop,,0,0,0,,Same thing, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.54,0:21:58.83,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'm a bounty hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.55,0:22:01.48,bebop,,0,0,0,,So, you're a Cowboy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.48,0:22:03.82,bebop,,0,0,0,,We used to be Cowboys too, in the old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.82,0:22:05.42,bebop,,0,0,0,,Good, we can talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.42,0:22:07.31,bebop,,0,0,0,,That's more reason not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.40,0:22:27.87,bebop,,0,0,0,,Are you looking for beans?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.71,0:22:38.14,bebop,,0,0,0,,You have beans that can't be seen with human eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.14,0:22:41.79,bebop,,0,0,0,,Of course.\NYou can get anything at Moroccan St.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.51,0:22:45.45,bebop,,0,0,0,,That's why you came?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.76,0:23:27.96,bebop,,0,0,0,,So would you like some pistachios?\NOr almonds?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.28,0:23:33.48,bebop,,0,0,0,,Calabar beans, they tell if your wife's cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.48,0:23:38.78,bebop,,0,0,0,,The innocent eat them all out at once and vomit them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.78,0:23:42.93,bebop,,0,0,0,,The guilty eat one at a time and the poison sets in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.93,0:23:44.40,bebop,,0,0,0,,That's how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.97,0:23:46.62,bebop,,0,0,0,,I don't have a wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.62,0:23:48.86,bebop,,0,0,0,,You're a lucky man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.86,0:23:50.26,bebop,,0,0,0,,What I want to know...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.26,0:23:54.89,bebop,,0,0,0,,Broad beans are bad.\NPythagoras died after eating them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.89,0:23:56.76,bebop,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate the bean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.77,0:24:05.47,bebop,,0,0,0,,I want to know about the virus from\Nthat truck accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.25,0:24:12.02,bebop,,0,0,0,,Do you believe in demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.02,0:24:15.69,bebop,,0,0,0,,With so much in the world about us,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.69,0:24:19.78,bebop,,0,0,0,,why does man's imagination go beyond that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.27,0:24:26.39,bebop,,0,0,0,,Why does man long for skies\Nand yearn for the universe?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.39,0:24:30.97,bebop,,0,0,0,,Because, in the old days, man used to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.97,0:24:32.72,bebop,,0,0,0,,Do they sell drugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.02,0:24:37.36,bebop,,0,0,0,,If you can imagine it, it can happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.36,0:24:39.59,bebop,,0,0,0,,Even if it cannot be seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.78,0:24:42.79,bebop,,0,0,0,,So you have the virus?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.94,0:24:45.79,bebop,,0,0,0,,That was no virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.75,0:25:27.87,bebop,,0,0,0,,Hello, Rashid.\NI've got a vase for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.87,0:25:29.95,bebop,,0,0,0,,This was made for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.61,0:25:35.04,bebop,,0,0,0,,No, he needs it more than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.04,0:25:38.09,bebop,,0,0,0,,Yes, my friend, it was made for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.09,0:25:39.85,bebop,,0,0,0,,Made for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.37,0:25:42.90,bebop,,0,0,0,,You should always buy such things.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.90,0:25:46.27,bebop,,0,0,0,,Look, I didn't come here for shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.27,0:25:49.04,bebop,,0,0,0,,You made a good buy.\NSee you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.04,0:25:50.48,bebop,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.48,0:25:51.91,bebop,,0,0,0,,Inshallah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.91,0:25:54.59,bebop,,0,0,0,,Hey! I said wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.72,0:26:39.68,bebop,,0,0,0,,Games from the 20th century are much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.68,0:26:43.10,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of the games they make today.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.10,0:26:46.69,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'm addicted to these old-school games.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.69,0:26:50.90,bebop,,0,0,0,,Back then they were happy with such games.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.90,0:26:52.63,bebop,,0,0,0,,Same with hackers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.63,0:26:55.73,bebop,,0,0,0,,Back in the good old days of Captain Crunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.73,0:27:00.17,bebop,,0,0,0,,Such a small thing,\Nbut now it's part of history.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.17,0:27:05.61,bebop,,0,0,0,,Everything's so well-guarded now,\Nit's hard to become famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.61,0:27:09.18,bebop,,0,0,0,,So I'm really impressed with what we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.18,0:27:11.40,bebop,,0,0,0,,I've long wanted to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.99,0:27:14.11,bebop,,0,0,0,,A real terrorist attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.87,0:27:32.71,bebop,,0,0,0,,Oh, no... he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.85,0:27:37.53,bebop,,0,0,0,,Your license.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.53,0:27:38.38,bebop,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.00,0:27:41.55,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's only the warehouse down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.97,0:27:50.31,bebop,,0,0,0,,Oh, no... he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.30,0:28:20.44,bebop,,0,0,0,,In those days,\Nthe sheriff could see his enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.44,0:28:24.22,bebop,,0,0,0,,So what was in that tanker truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.96,0:28:27.72,bebop,,0,0,0,,We haven't found a trace, yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.72,0:28:29.25,bebop,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.25,0:28:31.06,bebop,,0,0,0,,What I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.06,0:28:35.06,bebop,,0,0,0,,Something we can't see and we've never seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.40,0:28:48.56,bebop,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.56,0:28:53.04,bebop,,0,0,0,,A space truck was found\Nnear one of the asteroids.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.04,0:28:57.06,bebop,,0,0,0,,The driver was dead and the cargo gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.06,0:28:58.87,bebop,,0,0,0,,A truck hijack?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.87,0:29:03.90,bebop,,0,0,0,,The truck belonged to Cherious Medical.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.90,0:29:07.86,bebop,,0,0,0,,But they didn't report it missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.86,0:29:12.39,bebop,,0,0,0,,Rumor has it that it was carrying\Nsome sort of contraband.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.39,0:29:15.16,bebop,,0,0,0,,Soon after, the terrorists struck.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.16,0:29:16.54,bebop,,0,0,0,,Smells fishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.54,0:29:20.07,bebop,,0,0,0,,Cherious guard their secrets far too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.56,0:29:23.24,bebop,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you investigate them?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.24,0:29:25.93,bebop,,0,0,0,,Get them some trumped up charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.93,0:29:29.10,bebop,,0,0,0,,Things changed since you were a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.10,0:29:33.46,bebop,,0,0,0,,The ISSP has no teeth these days.\NWe're powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.28,0:29:37.69,bebop,,0,0,0,,Our bosses only think about their promotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.69,0:29:41.31,bebop,,0,0,0,,The rank and file are in cahoots with gangsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.31,0:29:43.79,bebop,,0,0,0,,We're so rotten we're falling apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.79,0:29:45.05,bebop,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.23,0:29:49.84,bebop,,0,0,0,,Things haven't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.84,0:29:51.26,bebop,,0,0,0,,That's why I quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.88,0:30:27.80,bebop,,0,0,0,,Ever heard of Purgatory?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.80,0:30:32.52,bebop,,0,0,0,,The place between Heaven and Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.75,0:30:39.29,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's where souls that didn't make it to Heaven\Nsuffer eternally.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.11,0:30:41.48,bebop,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.48,0:30:43.27,bebop,,0,0,0,,This world of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.28,0:30:48.28,bebop,,0,0,0,,Is this all there is?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.04,0:30:52.70,bebop,,0,0,0,,There are 30,000 units in the capsule.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.70,0:30:55.77,bebop,,0,0,0,,Once it's opened, they'll start to replicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.37,0:30:59.08,bebop,,0,0,0,,Be careful with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.08,0:31:01.15,bebop,,0,0,0,,Where's the money?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.22,0:31:10.09,bebop,,0,0,0,,That's less than we agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.10,0:31:12.73,bebop,,0,0,0,,You'll get the rest after the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.58,0:31:15.49,bebop,,0,0,0,,Then you can do as you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.02,0:31:19.59,bebop,,0,0,0,,Then I can say good-bye to this pitiful life.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.43,0:31:23.48,bebop,,0,0,0,,Can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.39,0:31:27.24,bebop,,0,0,0,,Why does it have to be Halloween?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.09,0:31:31.10,bebop,,0,0,0,,In the old days, Halloween was
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.10,0:31:33.73,bebop,,0,0,0,,the day when the souls in Purgatory could,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.73,0:31:36.11,bebop,,0,0,0,,through prayer, reach Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.68,0:31:39.83,bebop,,0,0,0,,Start praying.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.09,0:31:57.80,bebop,,0,0,0,,Hey, amigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.80,0:32:02.37,bebop,,0,0,0,,Hello to the solar system's\N3 million bounty hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.37,0:32:05.86,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's time for the Big Shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.86,0:32:09.65,bebop,,0,0,0,,Giving you full details of current bounties.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.65,0:32:13.95,bebop,,0,0,0,,Today's special show will run for an extra 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.95,0:32:17.39,bebop,,0,0,0,,We'll focus on the extraordinary bounty of
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.39,0:32:21.26,bebop,,0,0,0,,300 million offered by the Mars government.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.26,0:32:24.58,bebop,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's the largest bounty ever offered.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.58,0:32:28.41,bebop,,0,0,0,,But no one knows who or where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.41,0:32:30.25,bebop,,0,0,0,,Are there no clues?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.25,0:32:33.51,bebop,,0,0,0,,No, they left nothing at the scene
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.51,0:32:35.64,bebop,,0,0,0,,and no living witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.64,0:32:38.43,bebop,,0,0,0,,So how shall we do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.43,0:32:42.57,bebop,,0,0,0,,Well, we're offering a special prize to anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.57,0:32:45.15,bebop,,0,0,0,,who calls in information.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.15,0:32:50.15,bebop,,0,0,0,,Be the first to access the number on your screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.66,0:33:00.81,bebop,,0,0,0,,Let's take a commercial break.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.66,0:33:04.22,bebop,,0,0,0,,They're totally useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.22,0:33:05.80,bebop,,0,0,0,,Faye-Faye.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.52,0:33:08.40,bebop,,0,0,0,,Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.41,0:33:11.09,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's just like before.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.76,0:33:20.11,bebop,,0,0,0,,Tattoos?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.11,0:33:23.35,bebop,,0,0,0,,I searched for a matching symbol.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.11,0:33:26.10,bebop,,0,0,0,,Which one is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.10,0:33:29.62,bebop,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.50,0:33:31.79,bebop,,0,0,0,,This one?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.79,0:33:33.56,bebop,,0,0,0,,Is that a true lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.56,0:33:35.79,bebop,,0,0,0,,This one. No mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.32,0:33:42.32,bebop,,0,0,0,,Unit 7, Mars Special Forces Attack Team
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.32,0:33:45.55,bebop,,0,0,0,,Special Forces? So they're military?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.55,0:33:48.26,bebop,,0,0,0,,They were disbanded three years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.26,0:33:50.57,bebop,,0,0,0,,Any data on them?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.57,0:33:52.09,bebop,,0,0,0,,Ayyy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.93,0:33:58.94,bebop,,0,0,0,,What? Most of them are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.94,0:34:00.18,bebop,,0,0,0,,Nya.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.18,0:34:01.17,bebop,,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.17,0:34:01.88,bebop,,0,0,0,,Nya.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.64,0:34:04.18,bebop,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Ein?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.38,0:34:06.75,bebop,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.75,0:34:08.65,bebop,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, next!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.65,0:34:10.82,bebop,,0,0,0,,Ein says he's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.38,0:34:13.56,bebop,,0,0,0,,How would he know?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.56,0:34:17.74,bebop,,0,0,0,,Look, he died two years ago in the Titan Wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.74,0:34:21.14,bebop,,0,0,0,,I've had enough. Clean it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.14,0:34:22.24,bebop,,0,0,0,,Nya.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.24,0:34:25.55,bebop,,0,0,0,,I really hate this kind of boring desk work.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.42,0:34:27.00,bebop,,0,0,0,,Nya?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.72,0:34:32.19,bebop,,0,0,0,,I know somewhere there's a perfect job for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.19,0:34:33.24,bebop,,0,0,0,,Faye.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.24,0:34:38.46,bebop,,0,0,0,,Why do I have to waste my youth alongside these jerks?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.46,0:34:39.58,bebop,,0,0,0,,Faye-Faye...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.58,0:34:41.68,bebop,,0,0,0,,Where did I go wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.68,0:34:44.30,bebop,,0,0,0,,Lee is using his card again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.15,0:34:46.39,bebop,,0,0,0,,I forgot about the card!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.02,0:34:51.37,bebop,,0,0,0,,Is that a spittoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.37,0:34:52.40,bebop,,0,0,0,,Kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.79,0:34:58.40,bebop,,0,0,0,,Nya?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.03,0:35:00.57,bebop,,0,0,0,,An octopus tank?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.57,0:35:02.90,bebop,,0,0,0,,Kind of. What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.90,0:35:06.60,bebop,,0,0,0,,Ein says this guy is the one we're after.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.60,0:35:08.08,bebop,,0,0,0,,But Faye disagrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.36,0:35:12.58,bebop,,0,0,0,,But, unfortunately, he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.58,0:35:14.94,bebop,,0,0,0,,Vincent Volage.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.88,0:35:18.09,bebop,,0,0,0,,Any luck, Spike?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.20,0:35:22.36,bebop,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.36,0:35:24.61,bebop,,0,0,0,,A vase that's perfect for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.61,0:35:25.47,bebop,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.82,0:35:29.91,bebop,,0,0,0,,I love western movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.19,0:35:33.94,bebop,,0,0,0,,Give me a look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.51,0:35:36.14,bebop,,0,0,0,,Nya.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.91,0:35:43.13,bebop,,0,0,0,,I reckon we could sell Ed to a circus.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.13,0:35:45.36,bebop,,0,0,0,,I saw my old pal Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.36,0:35:48.90,bebop,,0,0,0,,A drug company is up to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.90,0:35:50.09,bebop,,0,0,0,,Drug company?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.84,0:35:52.65,bebop,,0,0,0,,There's something in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.30,0:35:57.17,bebop,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.23,0:36:11.39,bebop,,0,0,0,,You're pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.39,0:36:12.56,bebop,,0,0,0,,Here they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.86,0:36:16.38,bebop,,0,0,0,,Are you alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.38,0:36:18.61,bebop,,0,0,0,,Why don't we play together?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.61,0:36:22.82,bebop,,0,0,0,,I much prefer the real thing to virtual reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.82,0:36:24.20,bebop,,0,0,0,,The real thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.21,0:36:31.31,bebop,,0,0,0,,At last I've found you, Hacker Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.31,0:36:34.05,bebop,,0,0,0,,I only needed 500 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.05,0:36:37.16,bebop,,0,0,0,,Then Sporky Dorky appears.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.16,0:36:39.34,bebop,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.79,0:36:43.05,bebop,,0,0,0,,Damn it, it was my best score ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.02,0:36:49.60,bebop,,0,0,0,,How will you repay me, bounty hunter babe?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.60,0:36:52.31,bebop,,0,0,0,,Do you realize the trouble you're in?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.31,0:36:54.60,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's game over for you, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.53,0:36:58.74,bebop,,0,0,0,,You owe me for Sporky Dorky.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.53,0:37:08.03,bebop,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.85,0:37:10.66,bebop,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.82,0:37:21.42,bebop,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.61,0:37:47.55,bebop,,0,0,0,,That is so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.89,0:37:50.86,bebop,,0,0,0,,What's inside there?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.86,0:37:54.09,bebop,,0,0,0,,They're lymph corpuscles.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.09,0:37:57.59,bebop,,0,0,0,,The things you find in human blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.59,0:38:00.86,bebop,,0,0,0,,But this one is not normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.86,0:38:01.96,bebop,,0,0,0,,What's different?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.63,0:38:04.72,bebop,,0,0,0,,I don't get it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.51,0:38:08.60,bebop,,0,0,0,,This is a normal lymph corpuscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.60,0:38:12.06,bebop,,0,0,0,,But this one is slightly different.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.06,0:38:14.72,bebop,,0,0,0,,What's different?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.72,0:38:16.55,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'll blow it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.26,0:38:21.63,bebop,,0,0,0,,I still don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.63,0:38:24.99,bebop,,0,0,0,,Let's heat it in the microwave.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.99,0:38:29.18,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's really weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.15,0:38:47.36,bebop,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.12,0:39:29.34,bebop,,0,0,0,,Excuse me,\Nis this the Tortoise Cleaning Company?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.74,0:39:50.28,bebop,,0,0,0,,Make your report.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.28,0:39:54.35,bebop,,0,0,0,,The ISSP are treating it\Nas a terrorist attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.35,0:39:59.05,bebop,,0,0,0,,They're still investigating\Nbut have no firm leads yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.05,0:40:04.43,bebop,,0,0,0,,They're still analyzing as if it were a virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.43,0:40:08.51,bebop,,0,0,0,,We're safe for a while,\Nbut we mustn't waste time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.51,0:40:10.59,bebop,,0,0,0,,What about Mendelo, Colonel?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.59,0:40:14.96,bebop,,0,0,0,,We've had reports he's been seen in Moroccan St.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.96,0:40:19.31,bebop,,0,0,0,,I contacted my spies there\Nbut he'd already left.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.92,0:40:24.86,bebop,,0,0,0,,We have to make sure\Nthis doesn't go any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.86,0:40:28.53,bebop,,0,0,0,,Life on Mars could end because of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.53,0:40:33.08,bebop,,0,0,0,,But did Vincent actually activate the process?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.51,0:40:39.12,bebop,,0,0,0,,It is pure evil personified in a test tube.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.12,0:40:43.79,bebop,,0,0,0,,Its very existence is a threat to all life.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.79,0:40:48.50,bebop,,0,0,0,,Vincent and Mendelo don't deserve to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.79,0:40:51.24,bebop,,0,0,0,,You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.24,0:40:52.47,bebop,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.38,0:40:59.42,bebop,,0,0,0,,Have you seen my car?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.44,0:41:02.57,bebop,,0,0,0,,Didn't you just drive it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.10,0:41:48.76,bebop,,0,0,0,,Put your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.04,0:41:54.86,bebop,,0,0,0,,I know you from somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.64,0:41:58.64,bebop,,0,0,0,,I like your outfit, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.63,0:42:01.28,bebop,,0,0,0,,Yours doesn't suit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.28,0:42:02.15,bebop,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.02,0:42:04.55,bebop,,0,0,0,,Now turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.78,0:42:26.19,bebop,,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.19,0:42:30.27,bebop,,0,0,0,,Wanna flip a coin?\NIf it's heads, I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.34,0:42:46.50,bebop,,0,0,0,,You're pretty tough for a drug company office girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.50,0:42:49.71,bebop,,0,0,0,,Knowing too much can shorten your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.71,0:42:52.50,bebop,,0,0,0,,But tough girls are my type.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.40,0:43:25.20,bebop,,0,0,0,,Halt, or I shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.23,0:44:50.17,bebop,,0,0,0,,Happy Halloween, trick or treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.75,0:44:53.96,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'll make mischief\N'less you give something sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.96,0:44:57.31,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'm so tiny that no one can find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.31,0:44:59.76,bebop,,0,0,0,,So great no one can see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.76,0:45:02.91,bebop,,0,0,0,,But to the marrow, I'm part of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.91,0:45:05.33,bebop,,0,0,0,,What's he trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.33,0:45:09.28,bebop,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but as a statement, it's meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.28,0:45:12.88,bebop,,0,0,0,,Has anyone seen a really disgusting hat here?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.88,0:45:17.35,bebop,,0,0,0,,No time for that.\NWe've just had a terrorist statement.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.35,0:45:18.95,bebop,,0,0,0,,Probably a hoax.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.95,0:45:23.07,bebop,,0,0,0,,Perhaps, but yesterday's capsule makes it far too real.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.07,0:45:24.02,bebop,,0,0,0,,That vase?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.33,0:45:29.21,bebop,,0,0,0,,What we thought were lymph corpuscles
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.21,0:45:33.26,bebop,,0,0,0,,are actually a mass of micro robots.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.26,0:45:36.08,bebop,,0,0,0,,A new type of nano machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.08,0:45:37.53,bebop,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.80,0:45:39.78,bebop,,0,0,0,,Heard of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.78,0:45:41.29,bebop,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.29,0:45:42.80,bebop,,0,0,0,,What are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.80,0:45:46.80,bebop,,0,0,0,,Micro-robots, invisible to the naked eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.80,0:45:49.67,bebop,,0,0,0,,Made from a form of protein.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.84,0:45:55.90,bebop,,0,0,0,,You like your protein,\Nbut no way you could eat these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.90,0:45:58.85,bebop,,0,0,0,,Originally used for medical purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.85,0:46:01.38,bebop,,0,0,0,,So why put them in a vase?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.51,0:46:07.94,bebop,,0,0,0,,One clue is that lymph corpuscles\Nare composed of bone marrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.94,0:46:09.21,bebop,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.21,0:46:13.02,bebop,,0,0,0,,The one who made the statement knows that fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.02,0:46:14.00,bebop,,0,0,0,,Meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.82,0:46:16.26,bebop,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.26,0:46:20.06,bebop,,0,0,0,,What?\NWe still don't know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.06,0:46:22.22,bebop,,0,0,0,,What a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.33,0:46:25.74,bebop,,0,0,0,,How did it go at Cherious?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.74,0:46:30.53,bebop,,0,0,0,,Security is far heavier\Nthan their business demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.53,0:46:33.97,bebop,,0,0,0,,Their guards all carry G21 submachine guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.97,0:46:37.91,bebop,,0,0,0,,That's a military-issue weapon, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.91,0:46:40.44,bebop,,0,0,0,,Few civilians can get ahold of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.44,0:46:44.75,bebop,,0,0,0,,I saw a woman with the same tattoo as Vincent.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.75,0:46:47.17,bebop,,0,0,0,,And she was really...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.17,0:46:48.24,bebop,,0,0,0,,She was what?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.24,0:46:49.87,bebop,,0,0,0,,...quite beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.43,0:46:56.86,bebop,,0,0,0,,If the military is involved,\Nit's a whole new ball game.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.86,0:47:01.46,bebop,,0,0,0,,But it seems that the more we learn,\Nthe less we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.64,0:47:05.65,bebop,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.65,0:47:07.92,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'll sleep on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.90,0:47:11.16,bebop,,0,0,0,,"Everything comes to he who waits."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.08,0:47:13.97,bebop,,0,0,0,,Oh, I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.97,0:47:16.91,bebop,,0,0,0,,Has anyone seen that hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.91,0:47:18.72,bebop,,0,0,0,,No, I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.72,0:47:20.69,bebop,,0,0,0,,Where did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.35,0:47:25.57,bebop,,0,0,0,,What a weird smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.48,0:47:27.92,bebop,,0,0,0,,What is it, Ein?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.46,0:47:55.81,bebop,,0,0,0,,A-Nya.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.74,0:47:57.78,bebop,,0,0,0,,Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.85,0:48:07.23,bebop,,0,0,0,,Trick or treat?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.23,0:48:10.54,bebop,,0,0,0,,Idiot!\NHalloween's not till tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.66,0:48:20.27,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's not him, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.90,0:48:25.62,bebop,,0,0,0,,Trick or treat?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.62,0:48:29.21,bebop,,0,0,0,,You're welcome to trick me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.21,0:48:31.08,bebop,,0,0,0,,Treat, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.08,0:48:33.93,bebop,,0,0,0,,How about if I trick you, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.93,0:48:35.51,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'm not a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.23,0:48:39.47,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'm a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.47,0:48:42.65,bebop,,0,0,0,,I've got no time for women!\NGet lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.22,0:48:48.69,bebop,,0,0,0,,Not him, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.54,0:49:10.17,bebop,,0,0,0,,I've found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.80,0:49:17.83,bebop,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.83,0:49:19.74,bebop,,0,0,0,,I've found him!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.72,0:49:22.50,bebop,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.50,0:49:24.73,bebop,,0,0,0,,I've found Lee.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.73,0:49:26.86,bebop,,0,0,0,,Really? That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.86,0:49:30.02,bebop,,0,0,0,,I knew you were special.\NWhere are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.02,0:49:32.47,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'm sending my location now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.07,0:49:35.10,bebop,,0,0,0,,Watch him carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.10,0:49:37.56,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'll be right there, don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.56,0:49:40.76,bebop,,0,0,0,,I understand. Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.76,0:49:47.58,bebop alternative,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Trick or treat, trick or treat.\NGive me something good to eat.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.36,0:49:51.71,bebop,,0,0,0,,Level one cleared.\NThat was too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.81,0:49:56.18,bebop,,0,0,0,,You're always playing that.\NIs it fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.18,0:49:57.62,bebop,,0,0,0,,What game is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.38,0:50:02.62,bebop,,0,0,0,,She's just a stupid kid after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.90,0:50:09.35,bebop,,0,0,0,,Which building is he in?\NWhich apartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.18,0:50:15.10,bebop,,0,0,0,,In solitaire,\Nyou eliminate one piece at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.10,0:50:19.14,bebop,,0,0,0,,The one who has the last ball remaining wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.70,0:50:21.84,bebop,,0,0,0,,That's game over.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.84,0:50:22.99,bebop,,0,0,0,,Did you win?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.13,0:50:29.37,bebop,,0,0,0,,The real game starts now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.28,0:50:32.09,bebop,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.34,0:50:37.97,bebop,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me that's a capsule.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.97,0:50:39.30,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's just a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.32,0:50:45.29,bebop,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.29,0:50:47.82,bebop,,0,0,0,,You're kidding, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.66,0:50:52.77,bebop,,0,0,0,,Only one can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.41,0:51:48.41,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'll never get to see Sporky Dorky.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.75,0:51:54.75,bebop,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't you go and die on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.52,0:51:57.18,bebop,,0,0,0,,Press my restart button...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.95,0:53:20.76,bebop,,0,0,0,,Emergency call from Alpha 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.20,0:53:23.59,bebop,,0,0,0,,I've found Humpty Dumpty.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.59,0:53:27.97,bebop,,0,0,0,,Current location is 24.15, and he's mobile.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.97,0:53:31.63,bebop,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm on my way.\NWait till I get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.11,0:53:33.56,bebop,,0,0,0,,The game is afoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.92,0:53:39.98,bebop,,0,0,0,,Leaving sector 17, moving to 18.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.19,0:53:49.33,bebop,,0,0,0,,Heading for Central Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.55,0:54:10.55,bebop,,0,0,0,,This way, I'll follow you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.55,0:54:12.00,bebop,,0,0,0,,You stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.00,0:54:12.84,bebop,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.84,0:54:13.97,bebop,,0,0,0,,Watch the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.52,0:55:38.55,bebop,,0,0,0,,Vincent.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.02,0:55:43.58,bebop,,0,0,0,,I knew you by your smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.58,0:55:46.85,bebop,,0,0,0,,You stink of spilled blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.69,0:55:49.74,bebop,,0,0,0,,A bounty hunter, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.74,0:55:51.78,bebop,,0,0,0,,Bad luck for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.78,0:55:55.24,bebop,,0,0,0,,Blame those who put the bounty on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.78,0:56:44.30,bebop,,0,0,0,,Why don't you shoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.30,0:56:45.01,bebop,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.74,0:56:49.22,bebop,,0,0,0,,Or are you putting on a tough-guy act?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.42,0:56:52.55,bebop,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.55,0:56:56.30,bebop,,0,0,0,,No point. You're worth nothing dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.00,0:56:59.47,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.47,0:57:02.31,bebop,,0,0,0,,Death is but perchance to dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.31,0:57:05.11,bebop,,0,0,0,,To dream for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.38,0:57:09.11,bebop,,0,0,0,,You asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.89,0:58:19.64,bebop,,0,0,0,,Is that all you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.20,0:59:06.60,bebop,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.33,0:59:10.06,bebop,,0,0,0,,Spike Spiegel.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.48,0:59:13.29,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'll see you in the other world.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.29,0:59:14.53,bebop,,0,0,0,,Vincent!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.95,0:59:53.98,bebop,,0,0,0,,Vincent.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.57,0:59:56.78,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.26,1:00:38.11,bebop,,0,0,0,,Why only me?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.47,1:00:51.57,bebop,,0,0,0,,Vincent.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.20,1:01:21.02,bebop,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me, Spike?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.88,1:01:25.09,bebop,,0,0,0,,You almost didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.22,1:01:29.30,bebop,,0,0,0,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.30,1:01:32.31,bebop,,0,0,0,,No, he was dead from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.48,1:01:36.24,bebop,,0,0,0,,Just like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.84,1:02:03.70,bebop,,0,0,0,,He's the one who found the body
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.70,1:02:06.11,bebop,,0,0,0,,floating in the river.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.32,1:02:13.65,bebop,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.49,1:02:18.52,bebop,,0,0,0,,What did you see?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.52,1:02:21.31,bebop,,0,0,0,,You're on the verge of death.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.50,1:02:25.71,bebop,,0,0,0,,I was dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.62,1:02:29.30,bebop,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.30,1:02:30.81,bebop,,0,0,0,,Which is the dream?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.04,1:02:34.22,bebop,,0,0,0,,The first time ever...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.22,1:02:37.64,bebop,,0,0,0,,First time I've been truly scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.64,1:02:39.21,bebop,,0,0,0,,Shaking with fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.41,1:02:44.43,bebop,,0,0,0,,If one single atom had given way,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.15,1:02:47.46,bebop,,0,0,0,,I would have died.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.75,1:02:54.42,bebop,,0,0,0,,It was not destined to be your time to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.66,1:03:01.96,bebop,,0,0,0,,Swimming Bird...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.58,1:03:06.64,bebop,,0,0,0,,These blue eyes see everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.64,1:03:10.80,bebop,,0,0,0,,They see the past, the present and the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.96,1:03:16.47,bebop,,0,0,0,,They look upon the full flow of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.47,1:03:19.54,bebop,,0,0,0,,They see not the reality,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.54,1:03:22.51,bebop,,0,0,0,,they see only the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.15,1:03:27.03,bebop,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes of truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.03,1:03:30.12,bebop,,0,0,0,,There is nothing to fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.70,1:03:33.61,bebop,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.66,1:03:35.88,bebop,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.58,1:03:57.16,bebop,,0,0,0,,So you're not dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.69,1:04:04.79,bebop,,0,0,0,,What about him, Vincent?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.56,1:04:08.55,bebop,,0,0,0,,He disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.55,1:04:11.53,bebop,,0,0,0,,As if he was never there at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.00,1:04:18.02,bebop,,0,0,0,,We've gotten mixed up in something fatal.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.10,1:04:22.65,bebop,,0,0,0,,As my father always said
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.65,1:04:24.99,bebop,,0,0,0,,"The ship that sets sail"
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.99,1:04:28.67,bebop,,0,0,0,,"either keeps sailing, or it sinks."
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.85,1:04:32.86,bebop,,0,0,0,,We're just bounty hunters.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.86,1:04:36.67,bebop,,0,0,0,,This is far too big for the likes of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.40,1:04:39.72,bebop,,0,0,0,,We can still quit.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.72,1:04:42.19,bebop,,0,0,0,,We should back off.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.19,1:04:43.41,bebop,,0,0,0,,Okay, Spike?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.17,1:04:53.42,bebop,,0,0,0,,He can sleep anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.20,1:05:00.12,bebop,,0,0,0,,Why did you disobey orders?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.00,1:05:04.48,bebop,,0,0,0,,You don't wish to answer?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.48,1:05:07.32,bebop,,0,0,0,,Did you consider that disobeying orders
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.32,1:05:11.63,bebop,,0,0,0,,was the direct cause of\Nso many innocent deaths?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.64,1:05:13.96,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.76,1:05:18.19,bebop,,0,0,0,,You're restricted to barracks as of now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.19,1:05:21.63,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'll give my final decision at a later date.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.66,1:05:32.33,bebop,,0,0,0,,Watch her closely.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.65,1:05:38.43,bebop,,0,0,0,,Our investigation shows the element\Nused on the monorail
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.43,1:05:42.62,bebop,,0,0,0,,is the same as that from the tanker truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.09,1:05:46.93,bebop,,0,0,0,,Have you managed to identify that element?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.93,1:05:48.90,bebop,,0,0,0,,We're doing it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.90,1:05:52.47,bebop,,0,0,0,,The hacking of our computers was carried out
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.47,1:05:57.72,bebop,,0,0,0,,by one Lee Samson,\Nwith a similar MO in a previous attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.72,1:06:01.39,bebop,,0,0,0,,We're running a trace on his path of access.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.39,1:06:04.46,bebop,,0,0,0,,Any chance he's their leader?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.46,1:06:05.69,bebop,,0,0,0,,Yes, there is.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.69,1:06:10.02,bebop,,0,0,0,,We believe he has contact with terrorist groups.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.02,1:06:11.89,bebop,,0,0,0,,What is their aim?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.89,1:06:15.28,bebop,,0,0,0,,Is it ideological, or do they want money?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.60,1:06:18.37,bebop,,0,0,0,,We're still checking.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.91,1:06:23.15,bebop,,0,0,0,,Is everything still "being checked"?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.15,1:06:24.75,bebop,,0,0,0,,How long must we wait?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.75,1:06:28.18,bebop,,0,0,0,,The medicals should be ready by now!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.52,1:06:46.95,bebop,,0,0,0,,I feel so heavy...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.95,1:06:48.32,bebop,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.32,1:06:50.37,bebop,,0,0,0,,My legs feel heavy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.44,1:06:52.35,bebop,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.35,1:06:54.64,bebop,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.33,1:07:02.35,bebop,,0,0,0,,Circle's an eye ball.\NCircles are pretty.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.35,1:07:08.78,bebop,,0,0,0,,A wonderful taste just like black grapes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.78,1:07:11.92,bebop,,0,0,0,,I hacked into Cherious Medical.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.33,1:07:16.06,bebop,,0,0,0,,Check their trucking records for October 15.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.06,1:07:17.98,bebop,,0,0,0,,Uyyy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.98,1:07:19.85,bebop,,0,0,0,,Back on the job, Spike?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.85,1:07:23.04,bebop,,0,0,0,,No way. I'm just checking up.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.04,1:07:24.79,bebop,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I can't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.60,1:07:27.43,bebop,,0,0,0,,You sleep too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.59,1:07:39.94,bebop,,0,0,0,,Truck, truck, where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.94,1:07:43.32,bebop,,0,0,0,,It carried a load of macadamia nuts.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.32,1:07:45.16,bebop,,0,0,0,,Macadamia nuts?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.16,1:07:47.05,bebop,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't try to eat them.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.05,1:07:49.46,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'll check it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.46,1:07:51.81,bebop,,0,0,0,,"Macadamia Nuts Control Dept."
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.81,1:07:54.90,bebop,,0,0,0,,"Macadamia Nuts R&D Dept."
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.90,1:07:58.14,bebop,,0,0,0,,Why such attention to mere nuts?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.14,1:08:01.09,bebop,,0,0,0,,Ed, take a look into the R&D Dept.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.09,1:08:02.09,bebop,,0,0,0,,Ayyy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.33,1:08:06.56,bebop,,0,0,0,,Any clues to what they're doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.56,1:08:07.28,bebop,,0,0,0,,Nya.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.76,1:08:14.41,bebop,,0,0,0,,My hacking program has crashed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.41,1:08:16.71,bebop,,0,0,0,,Now? We were so close.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.71,1:08:20.26,bebop,,0,0,0,,Try another route and get a profile on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.26,1:08:21.54,bebop,,0,0,0,,Uuy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.49,1:08:26.75,bebop,,0,0,0,,Dr. Mendelo-Al-Hedia.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.75,1:08:30.55,bebop,,0,0,0,,At SIT he was researching nano machines.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.55,1:08:34.16,bebop,,0,0,0,,There's no way that's a drug company.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.16,1:08:36.46,bebop,,0,0,0,,They're developing nano machines\Nfor the military.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.88,1:08:41.07,bebop,,0,0,0,,And Vincent got his hand on'em,\Na guy who was listed as dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.07,1:08:46.66,bebop,,0,0,0,,But nano war machines were banned\Nby the Treaty of Amsterdam.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.66,1:08:51.36,bebop,,0,0,0,,If Vincent is plotting something,\Nthe military would do anything to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.38,1:08:54.94,bebop,,0,0,0,,And yet, he's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.50,1:09:21.80,bebop,,0,0,0,,Steve.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.80,1:09:24.22,bebop,,0,0,0,,What can I do for you, Electra?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.46,1:09:31.82,bebop,,0,0,0,,What's that?\NA blood sample?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.85,1:09:34.51,bebop,,0,0,0,,Check it out for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.31,1:09:38.15,bebop,,0,0,0,,Okay, if you agree to a date.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.90,1:09:42.65,bebop,,0,0,0,,Well, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.10,1:09:46.24,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'll reserve a table for Halloween night.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.74,1:10:19.73,bebop,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.24,1:10:23.24,bebop,,0,0,0,,Why am I still alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.95,1:10:26.65,bebop,,0,0,0,,What did you do to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.95,1:10:30.46,bebop,,0,0,0,,I gave you my blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.97,1:10:36.25,bebop,,0,0,0,,Now you won't die\Nwhen I unleash the power.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.27,1:10:38.59,bebop,,0,0,0,,Just like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.77,1:10:42.77,bebop,,0,0,0,,It won't be much longer now.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.76,1:10:52.81,bebop,,0,0,0,,Did you find what you wanted?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.15,1:11:02.05,bebop,,0,0,0,,No, just a lot of things I don't need.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.05,1:11:04.43,bebop,,0,0,0,,That's how the world turns out.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.43,1:11:08.72,bebop,,0,0,0,,There are people who make things\Nwe'll never want.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.55,1:11:12.45,bebop,,0,0,0,,Who's making these demons?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.71,1:11:19.49,bebop,,0,0,0,,Why did you give me that vase?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.49,1:11:22.10,bebop,,0,0,0,,It was perfect for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.10,1:11:24.84,bebop,,0,0,0,,I mean what was inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.84,1:11:27.66,bebop,,0,0,0,,Nano machines in the form of lymph corpuscles.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.66,1:11:28.97,bebop,,0,0,0,,Dr. Mendelo's.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.81,1:11:39.22,bebop,,0,0,0,,A man escaped here over three years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.06,1:11:45.32,bebop,,0,0,0,,He said he had made a hideous development.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.90,1:11:53.04,bebop,,0,0,0,,One that's programmed to spread through touch, or through the atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.04,1:11:59.74,bebop,,0,0,0,,In the blood, it assumes the form of lymph corpuscles, and endlessly replicates.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.74,1:12:02.85,bebop,,0,0,0,,Until it reaches the brain and destroys it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.63,1:12:07.94,bebop,,0,0,0,,Then it turns to protein and exits the body,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.94,1:12:10.86,bebop,,0,0,0,,leaving no trace at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.86,1:12:13.19,bebop,,0,0,0,,That's as much as I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.27,1:12:16.99,bebop,,0,0,0,,There's only one thing I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.81,1:12:21.12,bebop,,0,0,0,,How come Vincent is still alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.73,1:12:29.24,bebop,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.46,1:12:33.96,bebop,,0,0,0,,Are you doing this for money, for revenge?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.96,1:12:36.57,bebop,,0,0,0,,Or are you just enjoying it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.48,1:12:41.56,bebop,,0,0,0,,I am only trying to find the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.67,1:12:43.88,bebop,,0,0,0,,The door?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.88,1:12:48.70,bebop,,0,0,0,,Have you ever had a dream\Nwhere you're aware
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.70,1:12:53.29,bebop,,0,0,0,,that you are in the middle of a dream\Nbut can't wake up?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.94,1:12:56.72,bebop,,0,0,0,,That's where it started.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.47,1:13:00.98,bebop,,0,0,0,,From when I was still on Titan.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.85,1:13:05.82,bebop,,0,0,0,,Vincent was a guinea pig.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.82,1:13:10.76,bebop,,0,0,0,,He injected an anti-nano machine\Ninto Vincent's blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.87,1:13:13.99,bebop,,0,0,0,,Anti nano-machine?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.42,1:13:18.22,bebop,,0,0,0,,It replicates like nano machines.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.22,1:13:20.50,bebop,,0,0,0,,It destroys nano machines.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.93,1:13:23.28,bebop,,0,0,0,,It was a vaccine experiment.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.36,1:13:28.53,bebop,,0,0,0,,Vincent started it.\NOnly he can stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.02,1:13:32.90,bebop,,0,0,0,,But we don't know his motive.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.90,1:13:35.10,bebop,,0,0,0,,Maybe he doesn't have one.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.10,1:13:39.46,bebop,,0,0,0,,Perhaps he is just waiting for Judgment Day.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.05,1:13:45.42,bebop,,0,0,0,,Doesn't Dr. Mendelo have everything?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.42,1:13:48.19,bebop,,0,0,0,,Nano machines, the vaccine?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.06,1:13:54.32,bebop,,0,0,0,,He disappeared and deleted all data\Nfrom his computer.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.32,1:13:59.28,bebop,,0,0,0,,He never imagined anyone\Ncould use his discovery.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.72,1:14:04.29,bebop,,0,0,0,,He disappeared without a trace.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.24,1:14:08.50,bebop,,0,0,0,,No one can stop Vincent.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.92,1:14:14.29,bebop,,0,0,0,,I lost two things on Titan.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.29,1:14:15.92,bebop,,0,0,0,,One was my past.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.73,1:14:22.76,bebop,,0,0,0,,There were no opposing armies in that battle.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.76,1:14:28.23,bebop,,0,0,0,,They were all killed to test\Nthe nano machines as weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.11,1:14:31.32,bebop,,0,0,0,,I was used as a guinea pig.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.36,1:14:34.69,bebop,,0,0,0,,The only one who survived.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.96,1:14:39.41,bebop,,0,0,0,,I lost all memories of my early life.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.45,1:14:43.57,bebop,,0,0,0,,I didn't even know who I was.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.72,1:14:48.31,bebop,,0,0,0,,What was the other?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.31,1:14:49.87,bebop,,0,0,0,,Did you see the butterflies?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.16,1:14:54.76,bebop,,0,0,0,,I saw the butterflies.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.62,1:14:58.13,bebop,,0,0,0,,So many, so very beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.77,1:15:11.48,bebop,,0,0,0,,When the nano machines reach the brain,\Na light is seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.24,1:15:14.53,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's as if...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.53,1:15:17.60,bebop,,0,0,0,,...the most beautiful sight in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.00,1:15:29.98,bebop,,0,0,0,,I've talked long.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.00,1:15:36.26,bebop,,0,0,0,,Rashid, please give this to the doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.42,1:15:43.85,bebop,,0,0,0,,Should you happen to meet him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.89,1:15:46.26,bebop,,0,0,0,,Yes, I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.63,1:15:55.52,bebop,,0,0,0,,Okay then. Inshallah.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.91,1:16:18.22,bebop,,0,0,0,,What's this all about?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.22,1:16:22.62,bebop,,0,0,0,,We're the ones who'd like an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.62,1:16:26.47,bebop,,0,0,0,,Why does your blood have anti-nano machines?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.94,1:16:31.06,bebop,,0,0,0,,How did this escape our attention?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.60,1:16:37.18,bebop,,0,0,0,,We thought only Vincent had it.\NHow did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.18,1:16:39.07,bebop,,0,0,0,,Have you contacted him?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.87,1:16:43.88,bebop,,0,0,0,,We'll place you in protective custody.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.88,1:16:46.98,bebop,,0,0,0,,If I have the vaccine in my body,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.98,1:16:50.46,bebop,,0,0,0,,can't we use it to protect the population?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.46,1:16:52.54,bebop,,0,0,0,,You just don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.49,1:17:00.17,bebop,,0,0,0,,Our sole purpose is to completely destroy all record of the nano machines.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.17,1:17:04.93,bebop,,0,0,0,,With no records, they never existed.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.90,1:17:17.65,bebop,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.83,1:17:29.25,bebop,,0,0,0,,What is the bond\Nthat ties us all together?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.70,1:17:33.71,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's not as if we're family.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.71,1:17:36.57,bebop,,0,0,0,,There's no linking bond like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.57,1:17:41.14,bebop,,0,0,0,,We each go our own way and do as we please.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.14,1:17:43.68,bebop,,0,0,0,,They give me so much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.48,1:17:46.34,bebop,,0,0,0,,I've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.34,1:17:48.75,bebop,,0,0,0,,I want to be alone again.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.69,1:17:58.13,bebop,,0,0,0,,One more move and I win.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.45,1:18:06.80,bebop,,0,0,0,,Hey, leave them alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.50,1:18:18.19,bebop,,0,0,0,,But does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.19,1:18:20.64,bebop,,0,0,0,,So what if they don't come back?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.02,1:18:23.73,bebop,,0,0,0,,The toss of a coin.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.79,1:18:29.78,bebop,,0,0,0,,If it had come up tails,\Nl would've asked you on a date.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.78,1:18:33.35,bebop,,0,0,0,,Nothing special, mind you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.97,1:18:36.39,bebop,,0,0,0,,Aren't you scared?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.39,1:18:37.33,bebop,,0,0,0,,Scared?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.68,1:18:43.06,bebop,,0,0,0,,They'll either kill us\Nor wipe out our memories.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.29,1:18:47.08,bebop,,0,0,0,,We'll lose our identities, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.66,1:18:51.28,bebop,,0,0,0,,We'll be like living dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.28,1:18:52.78,bebop,,0,0,0,,Like Vincent?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.06,1:18:58.55,bebop,,0,0,0,,The reason you survived the attack is because
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.55,1:19:00.43,bebop,,0,0,0,,you have them in you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.43,1:19:04.68,bebop,,0,0,0,,That, what is it?\NNano machine vaccine?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.68,1:19:06.51,bebop,,0,0,0,,You know everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.51,1:19:08.54,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's like you said.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.00,1:19:12.30,bebop,,0,0,0,,Knowing too much can shorten my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.88,1:19:19.51,bebop,,0,0,0,,You're no ordinary bounty hunter,\NSpike Spiegel.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.51,1:19:22.46,bebop,,0,0,0,,You're too good to be just a soldier.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.34,1:19:26.42,bebop,,0,0,0,,My name is Electra Ovilo.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.72,1:19:29.56,bebop,,0,0,0,,So, now I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.56,1:19:30.95,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's a strong name.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.83,1:19:43.37,bebop,,0,0,0,,I didn't know I had them inside my body.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.01,1:19:51.28,bebop,,0,0,0,,Vincent was...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.62,1:19:56.08,bebop,,0,0,0,,...poor Vincent was all alone from birth.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.55,1:20:01.29,bebop,,0,0,0,,All he had, as a boy,\Nwas hate and the will to fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.08,1:20:04.21,bebop,,0,0,0,,No one has ever loved him.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.94,1:20:09.24,bebop,,0,0,0,,That's why I wanted to help him.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.64,1:20:14.65,bebop,,0,0,0,,I thought I could, but I was very wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.91,1:20:19.79,bebop,,0,0,0,,Back there, on the monorail,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.79,1:20:22.86,bebop,,0,0,0,,he looked at me as if he didn't know me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.04,1:20:27.65,bebop,,0,0,0,,He had forgotten all about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.93,1:20:31.52,bebop,,0,0,0,,Did you love him?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.32,1:20:34.98,bebop,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.51,1:20:41.15,bebop,,0,0,0,,Have you ever experienced\Na brand-new feeling
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.15,1:20:45.59,bebop,,0,0,0,,that welled up inside of your heart\Nand filled you
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.59,1:20:47.85,bebop,,0,0,0,,with indescribable pain?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.83,1:20:49.72,bebop,,0,0,0,,Yes, I have.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.52,1:20:56.91,bebop,,0,0,0,,Maybe I was looking to be saved.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.23,1:21:02.48,bebop,,0,0,0,,Years ago, when I was much younger,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.36,1:21:07.36,bebop,,0,0,0,,I was afraid of nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.36,1:21:10.79,bebop,,0,0,0,,I had not the slightest fear of death.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.77,1:21:13.79,bebop,,0,0,0,,I was ready to die anytime.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.79,1:21:18.48,bebop,,0,0,0,,But then I met a special woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.48,1:21:21.63,bebop,,0,0,0,,She made me want to go on living.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.59,1:21:26.04,bebop,,0,0,0,,For the first time, I was afraid of death.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.01,1:21:29.26,bebop,,0,0,0,,A feeling I'd never had before.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.24,1:21:34.86,bebop,,0,0,0,,Where is she now?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.86,1:21:36.52,bebop,,0,0,0,,She went away.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.50,1:21:44.16,bebop,,0,0,0,,You're the first person\NI can talk to like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.79,1:21:49.75,bebop,,0,0,0,,What's between you and Vincent?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.75,1:21:52.29,bebop,,0,0,0,,We share similar souls.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.09,1:21:56.55,bebop,,0,0,0,,That's why I must find him.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.37,1:22:21.66,bebop,,0,0,0,,He said his name was Spike, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.63,1:22:28.13,bebop,,0,0,0,,So, he's a friend of yours?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.13,1:22:29.86,bebop,,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.66,1:22:32.35,bebop,,0,0,0,,What do you plan to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.20,1:22:36.10,bebop,,0,0,0,,I came here to finish it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.70,1:22:40.22,bebop,,0,0,0,,The final party begins.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.61,1:22:44.70,bebop,,0,0,0,,My next trick is special nano machines.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.76,1:22:51.11,bebop,,0,0,0,,These will not self-destruct,\Nthey will multiply until...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.60,1:22:54.99,bebop,,0,0,0,,You plan to destroy the world?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.99,1:22:58.74,bebop,,0,0,0,,You... you're insane.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.74,1:23:00.13,bebop,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.71,1:23:05.08,bebop,,0,0,0,,Who decides where to draw the line of insanity?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.14,1:23:09.87,bebop,,0,0,0,,Aren't there those who cross\Nand recross the line?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.96,1:23:13.00,bebop,,0,0,0,,Soon you will understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.98,1:23:17.51,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's not me.\NThe rest of the world is insane.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.36,1:23:20.65,bebop,,0,0,0,,Will you join me?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.21,1:23:26.39,bebop,,0,0,0,,We'll be the only ones left alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.39,1:23:28.32,bebop,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.32,1:23:32.52,bebop,,0,0,0,,I don't know what will happen,\Nbut I don't want that.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.48,1:23:49.72,bebop,,0,0,0,,Do it by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.98,1:24:03.97,bebop,,0,0,0,,Vincent!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.97,1:24:06.41,bebop,,0,0,0,,I said never to come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.41,1:24:09.39,bebop,,0,0,0,,Everything is ready, \NJack is in place.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.39,1:24:13.99,bebop,,0,0,0,,I want to get away.\NThe cops are closing in.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.99,1:24:15.72,bebop,,0,0,0,,Pay me what you owe me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.72,1:24:17.21,bebop,,0,0,0,,Have you prayed?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.32,1:24:40.88,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'll be at the bridge\Nconnecting this world to Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.88,1:24:46.26,bebop,,0,0,0,,You can watch it all alone from Purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.00,1:25:00.47,bebop,,0,0,0,,What will happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.26,1:25:04.35,bebop,,0,0,0,,You're a soldier, you're prepared for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.54,1:25:12.86,bebop,,0,0,0,,Do I get a cigarette?\NOne will do.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.86,1:25:13.64,bebop,,0,0,0,,Shall I, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.64,1:25:14.17,bebop,,0,0,0,,Ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.36,1:25:22.83,bebop,,0,0,0,,No, wait, don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.83,1:25:26.05,bebop,,0,0,0,,Throw down the gun.\NOpen the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.25,1:25:28.39,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'll have these.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.01,1:25:36.84,bebop,,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.84,1:25:38.79,bebop,,0,0,0,,At the waterworks.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.79,1:25:43.72,bebop,,0,0,0,,I tracked Lee's hack route to the waterworks.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.72,1:25:48.42,bebop,,0,0,0,,So he plans to put it\Ninto the city's water supply.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.42,1:25:50.31,bebop,,0,0,0,,The anti-terrorist squad.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.16,1:25:53.98,bebop,,0,0,0,,That'll fix him!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.98,1:25:57.00,bebop,,0,0,0,,Don't we need permission?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.00,1:26:00.31,bebop,,0,0,0,,If we don't, there'll be serious trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.20,1:26:03.38,bebop,,0,0,0,,This is a no-smoking area.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.04,1:26:09.68,bebop,,0,0,0,,If we go through the channels,\Nwe'll run out of time!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.39,1:26:20.14,bebop,,0,0,0,,We've got a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.10,1:26:22.68,bebop,,0,0,0,,Where's your blood sample?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.52,1:26:28.40,bebop,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.78,1:26:32.69,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's open.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.62,1:26:34.83,bebop,,0,0,0,,Protective suits?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.83,1:26:35.91,bebop,,0,0,0,,No time!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.52,1:26:37.70,bebop,,0,0,0,,They're behind us.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.96,1:26:44.85,bebop,,0,0,0,,Where's Electra's vaccine?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.85,1:26:49.67,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's being cultured in number 3, no, number 2 case.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.67,1:26:50.54,bebop,,0,0,0,,This?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.54,1:26:53.08,bebop,,0,0,0,,Yes, the yellow packs.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.20,1:26:59.48,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'm not lying,\Nbut it's not finished yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.02,1:27:03.66,bebop,,0,0,0,,In 20 hours,\Neach pack will have 100,000 units.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.32,1:27:08.82,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Electra.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.14,1:27:12.62,bebop,,0,0,0,,You can get out through level three.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.17,1:27:15.01,bebop,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.02,1:27:19.45,bebop,,0,0,0,,So no date, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.50,1:28:12.02,bebop,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.02,1:28:15.04,bebop,,0,0,0,,ISSP. We're taking over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.58,1:28:17.43,bebop,,0,0,0,,I've had no such orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.43,1:28:20.19,bebop,,0,0,0,,We ask your cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.87,1:28:27.07,bebop,,0,0,0,,I can't let anyone see me like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.49,1:28:33.23,bebop,,0,0,0,,Rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.78,1:28:40.15,bebop,,0,0,0,,Waiting for a call?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.15,1:28:41.85,bebop,,0,0,0,,No, not particularly.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.71,1:28:45.74,bebop,,0,0,0,,Aren't you waiting for Spike and Faye to call?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.74,1:28:50.41,bebop,,0,0,0,,What?\NI didn't notice them leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.72,1:28:53.51,bebop,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.05,1:28:55.81,bebop,,0,0,0,,Vincent has gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.81,1:28:58.98,bebop,,0,0,0,,Where the hell have you been?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.98,1:29:03.13,bebop,,0,0,0,,He's planning a very nasty Halloween party.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.13,1:29:05.75,bebop,,0,0,0,,How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.75,1:29:07.02,bebop,,0,0,0,,Spike!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.02,1:29:09.95,bebop,,0,0,0,,You idiot!\NWhere the hell were you?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.06,1:29:14.13,bebop,,0,0,0,,ISSP are headed for the waterworks.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.13,1:29:15.37,bebop,,0,0,0,,City waterworks?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.84,1:29:47.76,bebop,,0,0,0,,No.2 gate all clear, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.76,1:29:51.21,bebop,,0,0,0,,No.3 tank shows no abnormalities, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.21,1:29:54.97,bebop,,0,0,0,,A suspicious object\Nnear the gate to no.4 plant.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.11,1:29:58.25,bebop,,0,0,0,,Bomb squad on the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.25,1:30:00.41,bebop,,0,0,0,,Object appears to be...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.12,1:30:03.57,bebop,,0,0,0,,...a pumpkin-shaped balloon.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.28,1:30:12.80,bebop,,0,0,0,,That's strange.\NWhy is he dressed like a warlock?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.31,1:30:16.96,bebop,,0,0,0,,There's a Halloween costume parade in Alva City.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.96,1:30:19.71,bebop,,0,0,0,,So he wants to blend in?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.71,1:30:23.16,bebop,,0,0,0,,He'll do it in the middle of town?\NBut how?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.16,1:30:26.87,bebop,,0,0,0,,His accomplice said Jack was in place.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.87,1:30:27.81,bebop,,0,0,0,,Jack...?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.90,1:30:30.03,bebop,,0,0,0,,Yes, I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.57,1:30:34.54,bebop,,0,0,0,,Jack-o'-lantern?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.54,1:30:36.39,bebop,,0,0,0,,Yes, a Halloween lamp.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.67,1:30:40.17,bebop,,0,0,0,,We're starting now.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.25,1:30:57.29,bebop,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.83,1:31:20.62,bebop,,0,0,0,,Unit A, report!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.62,1:31:21.72,bebop,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.72,1:31:23.95,bebop,,0,0,0,,Find out what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.86,1:31:26.67,bebop,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.67,1:31:27.12,bebop,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.48,1:31:30.10,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's the army, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.63,1:31:32.81,bebop,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.81,1:31:33.88,bebop,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.73,1:31:37.41,bebop,,0,0,0,,Who's in charge?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.41,1:31:40.39,bebop,,0,0,0,,Who ordered the army to take over?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.39,1:31:41.67,bebop,,0,0,0,,That's classified.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.53,1:31:45.45,bebop,,0,0,0,,We're in charge now.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.45,1:31:47.43,bebop,,0,0,0,,What gives you the right?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.43,1:31:48.86,bebop,,0,0,0,,National emergency.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.86,1:31:50.06,bebop,,0,0,0,,A what!?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.06,1:31:51.41,bebop,,0,0,0,,Test results are in.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.45,1:31:57.25,bebop,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.25,1:31:59.39,bebop,,0,0,0,,I told you to leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.39,1:32:00.42,bebop,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.42,1:32:05.10,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's composed of nitrogen, oxygen and carbon dioxide,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.10,1:32:07.16,bebop,,0,0,0,,with traces of argon, neon and krypton.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.16,1:32:10.08,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's... air, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.14,1:32:20.06,bebop,,0,0,0,,But the town will be full of jack-o'-lanterns.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.06,1:32:23.99,bebop,,0,0,0,,He said he'd be at the bridge\Njoining here to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.99,1:32:25.10,bebop,,0,0,0,,What's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.10,1:32:28.81,bebop,,0,0,0,,Jet, we need 20-30 aircraft\Nas soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.81,1:32:31.81,bebop,,0,0,0,,What are you planning to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.81,1:32:33.56,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'll take the Swordfish.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.56,1:32:35.18,bebop,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.73,1:32:43.58,bebop,,0,0,0,,Faye, go to the weather control center.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.58,1:32:45.58,bebop,,0,0,0,,Hey, not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.58,1:32:49.79,bebop,,0,0,0,,You can't beat Vincent.\NHe's indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.79,1:32:51.91,bebop,,0,0,0,,We have unfinished business.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.91,1:32:53.17,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.79,1:32:58.23,bebop,,0,0,0,,If he wanted to destroy the world,\Nhe would have done it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.13,1:33:04.18,bebop,,0,0,0,,This invitation says the party\Nwon't start without the guest.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.60,1:33:08.43,bebop,,0,0,0,,If you don't go, the party won't start.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.02,1:33:11.00,bebop,,0,0,0,,Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.40,1:33:16.39,bebop,,0,0,0,,Only death cures stupidity.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.10,1:33:25.78,bebop,,0,0,0,,The army. What a nuisance!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.35,1:33:50.35,bebop,,0,0,0,,I've no time to play with you!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.11,1:34:41.53,bebop,,0,0,0,,But it's an emergency, we need help!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.53,1:34:44.36,bebop,,0,0,0,,But we have rules...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.36,1:34:49.15,bebop,,0,0,0,,All our fighter jets are\Nat the air show celebration.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.15,1:34:53.29,bebop,,0,0,0,,There's no time.\NAnything that can fly will do!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.61,1:34:57.20,bebop,,0,0,0,,You said anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.86,1:35:12.81,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's too early to start the party.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.91,1:36:56.19,bebop,,0,0,0,,They made good planes back in those days.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.19,1:36:58.36,bebop,,0,0,0,,Can they actually fly?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.71,1:37:04.94,bebop,,0,0,0,,We'll have no trouble spraying the vaccine for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.94,1:37:07.87,bebop,,0,0,0,,Don't overdo it, old fella.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.87,1:37:10.50,bebop,,0,0,0,,Where are we headed? Saturn?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.50,1:37:14.62,bebop,,0,0,0,,We're only going as far as Alva City.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.62,1:37:18.04,bebop,,0,0,0,,No, we're going to vaccinate the city\Nto save it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.04,1:37:20.21,bebop,,0,0,0,,I was just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.23,1:37:42.15,bebop,,0,0,0,,They can really fly!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.34,1:37:48.96,bebop,,0,0,0,,They're all museum pieces,\Nhaven't been flown for decades.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.89,1:39:13.88,bebop,,0,0,0,,Don't give up now!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.48,1:39:43.83,bebop,,0,0,0,,Taxi!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.61,1:39:47.57,bebop,,0,0,0,,Who's in charge?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.90,1:39:50.31,bebop,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.33,1:39:54.76,bebop,,0,0,0,,As you can see, I'm just a terrorist.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.40,1:40:01.14,bebop,,0,0,0,,What do you want here?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.14,1:40:03.00,bebop,,0,0,0,,Your demands?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.00,1:40:05.00,bebop,,0,0,0,,I want it to rain.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.35,1:40:07.10,bebop,,0,0,0,,What for?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.82,1:40:09.05,bebop,,0,0,0,,Well, how about...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.43,1:40:12.11,bebop,,0,0,0,,...rain on the parade?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.22,1:41:39.94,bebop,,0,0,0,,This is hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.88,1:41:43.82,bebop,,0,0,0,,The parade is tying up traffic everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.34,1:41:50.46,bebop,,0,0,0,,The bridge to Heaven?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.65,1:41:58.21,bebop,,0,0,0,,You forgot to pay!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.48,1:43:11.45,bebop,,0,0,0,,Has the party begun?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.93,1:43:15.91,bebop,,0,0,0,,It's just starting.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.68,1:43:26.93,bebop,,0,0,0,,Reminds me of the sinking of Bismarck.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.93,1:43:30.55,bebop,,0,0,0,,You old liar, that was back in WWII.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.55,1:43:33.43,bebop,,0,0,0,,We're almost there.\NGet ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.47,1:44:25.53,bebop,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd come, bounty hunter.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.17,1:44:30.03,bebop,,0,0,0,,Last time, I decided to miss the fatal spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.06,1:44:34.03,bebop,,0,0,0,,Your eyes are more than empty holes.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.41,1:45:45.83,bebop,,0,0,0,,Come to save the world, have you?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.83,1:45:47.87,bebop,,0,0,0,,You're too late for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.69,1:45:52.93,bebop,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm just a bounty hunter.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.93,1:45:55.28,bebop,,0,0,0,,Saving the world is not my business.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.92,1:45:59.79,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'm only here to get revenge on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.40,1:46:02.60,bebop,,0,0,0,,You think this is just a threat?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.60,1:46:04.00,bebop,,0,0,0,,I will do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.00,1:46:05.50,bebop,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.49,1:47:57.22,bebop,,0,0,0,,Before you die, tell me one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.64,1:48:01.40,bebop,,0,0,0,,I died up there on Titan.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.37,1:48:06.97,bebop,,0,0,0,,Is this world the one the butterflies\Nshowed me in the dream?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.79,1:48:13.44,bebop,,0,0,0,,Or is that world the actual reality?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.44,1:48:16.02,bebop,,0,0,0,,And my world just a dream?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.54,1:48:20.12,bebop,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.70,1:48:23.01,bebop,,0,0,0,,Vincent!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.14,1:48:29.02,bebop,,0,0,0,,You won't get away this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.36,1:48:35.90,bebop,,0,0,0,,No.\NStay back, Electra...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.11,1:48:40.50,bebop,,0,0,0,,Shall we go?\NTogether?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.86,1:48:56.02,bebop,,0,0,0,,Vincent!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.71,1:49:03.56,bebop,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you shoot?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.96,1:49:07.41,bebop,,0,0,0,,I remembered.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.59,1:49:10.81,bebop,,0,0,0,,She was the one I loved.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.91,1:49:17.25,bebop,,0,0,0,,I wanted to escape from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.25,1:49:21.07,bebop,,0,0,0,,I searched for the door out of this world.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.35,1:49:27.43,bebop,,0,0,0,,But now I understand, there is no door.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.84,1:49:31.44,bebop,,0,0,0,,You should've known.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.44,1:49:35.70,bebop,,0,0,0,,You were frightened to open your eyes and see.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.70,1:49:36.59,bebop,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.57,1:49:39.62,bebop,,0,0,0,,Electra...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.62,1:49:43.85,bebop,,0,0,0,,The time I spent together with you
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.85,1:49:45.91,bebop,,0,0,0,,was my only reality.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.72,1:49:54.88,bebop,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad we could meet again at the end...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.89,1:50:17.88,bebop,,0,0,0,,What did the rain do?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.55,1:50:22.58,bebop,,0,0,0,,It spread the vaccine much faster
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.58,1:50:25.13,bebop,,0,0,0,,than the nano machines could act.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.96,1:50:28.65,bebop,,0,0,0,,Do you think there'll be a rainbow?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.88,1:50:30.80,bebop,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.80,1:50:31.84,bebop,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.84,1:50:33.14,bebop,,0,0,0,,Wanna go to the races?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.36,1:50:38.90,bebop,,0,0,0,,You never learn, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.08,1:54:32.58,bebop,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He was always alone,{\i0}\N{\i1}always by himself.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.37,1:54:37.27,bebop,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Never anyone to share the game.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.52,1:54:40.27,bebop,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He lived in another world.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.93,1:54:43.40,bebop,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He was that kinda guy.{\i0}
